<title>HONG KONG: NatWest sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>NatWest sets warrants on Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Financial Products plc said on Friday it has issued 69 million American-style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$74	    PREMIUM	    16 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.184	 GEARING	    6.25X</p>
<p>EXPIRATION	 02.MAR.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  18.MAR.97</p>
<p>LISTING	    HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     19.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE  HK$74	    MIN EXER LOT     10,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
